<%- include("../../partials/breadcrumb-nav") %>

<section class="layout-container">
    <div class="additional-info">
        <!--Heading-->
        <div class="generic-heading__row ">
            <div class="__divider">
                <div class="__dot"></div>
                <div class="__line"></div>

            </div>
            <div class="generic-heading__title-group" id="bright-group-institutions">
                <h2 style="color: var(--color-primary) ;">Bright Group of Institutions</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="__divider" style="color: #262c56;">
                <div class="__line"></div>
                <div class="__dot"></div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <h5>( Managed by Bright Educational Charitable Trust, Estd: 2007; Premier organisation
            in Odisha since 1986 )
        </h5>

        <section class="institutes-section side-by-side">

            <!-- LEFT SIDE -->
            <div class="institutes-list">

                <div class="institute-card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <img src="/images/logo/logo1.png" alt="Bright College of Nursing Logo">
                        <h4 style="color: var(--color-accent2);">Bright College of Nursing</h4>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card-courses">
                        <a href="/courses/bsc-nursing" class="course-pill">BSc Nursing</a>
                        <a href="/courses/pbbsc-nursing" class="course-pill">PBBSc Nursing</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="institute-card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <img src="/images/logo/logo1.png" alt="Bright School of Nursing Logo">
                        <h4 style="color: var(--color-accent2);">Bright School of Nursing</h4>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card-courses">
                        <a href="/courses/GNM" class="course-pill">GNM</a>
                        <a href="/courses/ANM" class="course-pill">ANM</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="institute-card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <img src="/images/logo/DMLT_logo.jpeg" alt="Bright Institute of Medical Technology Logo">
                        <h4 style="color: var(--color-accent2);">Bright Institute of Medical Technology</h4>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card-courses">
                        <a href="/courses/DMLT" class="course-pill">DMLT</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

            <!-- RIGHT SIDE -->
            <div class="institutes-image">
                <div class="slider-wrapper">

                    <% sliderImages.forEach((img, index) => { %>
                    <img src="<%= img.src %>" alt="<%= img.alt || 'slider image' %>"
                        class="slide <%= index === 0 ? 'active' : '' %>" loading="lazy">
                    <% }) %>

                    <div class="slider-controls">
                        <button class="slider-btn left prevSlide">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
                        </button>

                        <button class="slider-btn right nextSlide">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

        </section>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="layout-container" id="about-institution">
    <!--About Us Heading-->
    <div class="generic-heading__row ">
        <div class="generic-heading__title-group">
            <div class="red-vertical__accent"></div>
            <h2 class="at-glance__title">About Us</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="__divider">
            <div class="__line"></div>
            <div class="__dot"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!--About Us Message-->
    <div class="generic-paragraph">
        <div class="generic-paragraph__content">
            <h5>
                Welcome to Bright Group of Institutions, where excellence meets compassion! Our institution is dedicated
                to shaping the next generation of highly skilled and empathetic nursing professionals. Join us in your
                journey towards a rewarding and impactful career in healthcare.
            </h5>

            <p>
                Under the esteemed management of the Bright Educational Charitable Trust which is established in the
                year 2007, our group of institutions is dedicated to delivering excellence in healthcare and
                professional education. With a strong commitment to quality, innovation, and service to society, we have
                established a reputation as a trusted name in Odisha for nurturing skilled and compassionate
                professionals.
                Our institutions are designed to cater to diverse areas of healthcare education, each focusing on
                specialized training, academic excellence, and practical exposure.
                The Trust also carries a rich legacy in technical and professional education. Under its umbrella, the
                Institute of Bright Engineers, established in 1986, has been a premier organization in Odisha imparting
                quality education in B.Tech, Diploma Engineering, MBA and other programs. This strong foundation
                reflects our long-standing commitment to academic excellence and professional development.

            </p>

            <h5>About Our Institutions</h5>

            <p>
                With a legacy of excellence and a future-focused approach on advanced nursing education, modern teaching
                methodologies, and extensive clinical training; our institutions continue to empower students to build
                successful careers and aims to produce qualified nurses capable of delivering high-quality patient care
                in the various healthcare sector and contribute meaningfully to society.
                We are dedicated to shaping the future of nursing by fostering knowledge, skills, and values that
                empower students to contribute meaningfully to the healthcare sector both nationally and globally.
            </p>

            <h5>Our Commitment</h5>
            <span>
                Across all our institutions, we are dedicated to:
            </span>

            <ul class="li-dot">
                <li>Delivering <strong>quality education with practical exposure</strong> &hyphen; </li>
                <li>Developing <strong>skilled, ethical,</strong> and <strong>compassionate professionals</strong></li>
                <li>Providing <strong>modern infrastructure</strong> and <strong>advanced laboratories</strong></li>
                <li>Ensuring <strong>strong clinical</strong> and <strong>industry training support</strong></li>
                <li>Promoting <strong>community health</strong> and <strong>social responsibility</strong></li>
            </ul>

            <div class="section-heading__title">
                <h4>Bright College of Nursing</h4>
            </div>

            <span>Bright College of Nursing is committed to preparing highly competent and professional nursing
                graduates. The college offers:
            </span>

            <strong>
                <ul class="li-dot">
                    <li><a href="/courses/bsc-nursing">B.Sc. Nursing</a> </li>
                    <li><a href="/courses/pbbsc-nursing"></a>PBB.Sc. Nursing </li>
                </ul>
            </strong>

            <p>Bright College of Nursing is a premier institution dedicated to excellence in nursing and healthcare
                education. The college is managed by the <strong>Bright Educational Charitable Trust</strong>,
                established in 2007 with a
                vision to promote quality education and develop skilled healthcare professionals committed to serving
                society.
                Our academic framework integrates strong theoretical foundations with hands-on clinical training,
                enabling students to meet the evolving challenges of the healthcare sector with confidence and
                competence.
                With experienced faculty, modern infrastructure, advanced laboratories, and well-structured clinical
                training programs, Bright College of Nursing is committed to nurturing compassionate, competent, and
                ethical healthcare professionals who can serve both national and global communities.
            </p>

            <div class="section-heading__title">
                <h4>Bright School of Nursing</h4>
            </div>

            <span>Bright School of Nursing focuses on building a strong foundation in nursing care and community health
                services. The school offers:
            </span>

            <strong>
                <ul class="li-dot">
                    <li><a href="/courses/gnm">GNM (General Nursing & Midwifery)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/courses/anm">ANM (Auxiliary Nurse Midwifery)</a></li>
                </ul>
            </strong>

            <span>Our curriculum is designed to combine strong theoretical knowledge with practical clinical exposure,
                ensuring that students are well-prepared to meet the demands of the modern healthcare industry.
            </span>
            <br>
            <span>
                With experienced faculty, modern infrastructure, well-equipped laboratories, and strong clinical
                training support, We strives to nurture competent, compassionate, and ethical healthcare professionals.
            </span>
            <br>
            <span>
                These programs are designed to equip students with essential nursing skills, practical knowledge, and a
                compassionate approach to patient care, especially at the grassroots and community level.
            </span>

            <div class="section-heading__title">
                <h4>Bright Institute of Medical Technology</h4>
            </div>

            <span>Bright Institute of Medical Technology specializes in allied healthcare education, preparing students
                for vital roles in medical diagnostics and laboratory services. The institute offers:
            </span>

            <strong>
                <ul class="li-dot">
                    <li><a href="/courses/dmlt">DMLT (Diploma in Medical Laboratory Technology)</a></li>
                </ul>
            </strong>

            <span>The program emphasizes technical expertise, laboratory skills, and accuracy in diagnostics, which are
                crucial for modern healthcare systems.
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="info-section">
            <div class="additional-info">
                <h3>Additional Information</h3>
                <ul class="additional-info__list">
                    <li class="underline_text">
                        <a href="/about/director-message">
                            Chairman's Message
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="underline_text">Campus Life</li>
                    <li class="underline_text">Academics</li>
                    <li class="underline_text">Lab Facilities</li>
                    <li class="underline_text">
                        <a href="/about/contacts">
                            Contacts
                        </a>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="layout-container" id="mission-vision">
    <!--Mission & Vision Heading-->
    <div class="generic-heading__row ">
        <div class="generic-heading__title-group">
            <div class="red-vertical__accent"></div>
            <h2>Mission &amp; Vision</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="__divider">
            <div class="__line"></div>
            <div class="__dot"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h4 style="margin-top: 1rem;">Our Mission</h4>

    <ul class="li-bullet">
        <li>To provide high-quality nursing education through innovative, modern teaching and learning methods.</li>
        <li>To develop professional competence and critical thinking among students.</li>
        <li>To promote ethical values, compassion, and professionalism among students.</li>
        <li>To encourage research, lifelong learning, and leadership in healthcare.</li>
        <li>To prepare nurses capable of serving society with dedication and responsibility.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4 style="margin-top: 1rem;">Our Vision</h4>

    <!--Mission & Vision Message-->
    <div class="generic-paragraph">
        <div class="generic-paragraph__content">
            <span>
                We envision as a <strong>beacon of light in healthcare education</strong>, where passion meets purpose
                and learning
                becomes a lifelong journey of compassion.
            </span>
            <span>
                Our dream is to see every graduate walk out of our doors not just with a degree, but with the
                confidence, courage, and heart to face the world as a caregiver, a leader, and a change-maker.
            </span>
            <span>
                We strive to create a community where kindness is powerful, learning is sacred, and every student is
                inspired to rise, serve, and shine&hyphen;wherever life takes them.
            </span>
            <span>
                To be a center of excellence in nursing and healthcare education, recognized for producing highly
                skilled, compassionate, and socially responsible healthcare professionals who contribute significantly
                to the well-being of society.
            </span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h4 style="margin-top: 1rem;">Core Values</h4>

    <ul class="li-bullet">
        <li><strong>Excellence</strong> &hyphen; Striving for the highest standards in education and patient care </li>
        <li><strong>Compassion</strong> &hyphen; Delivering care with empathy, kindness, and respect </li>
        <li><strong>Integrity</strong> &hyphen; Upholding honesty, transparency, and ethical practices </li>
        <li><strong>Professionalism</strong> &hyphen; Maintaining discipline, accountability, and dedication</li>
        <li><strong>Innovation</strong> &hyphen; Embracing modern technologies and advanced learning methods</li>
        <li><strong>Service to Society</strong> &hyphen; Committing to community health and social well-being</li>
    </ul>

    <h4 style="margin-top: 1rem;">PHILOSOPHY</h4>

    <ul class="li-dot">
        <li>The philosophy of Bright group of Institutions is based on the belief that nursing is both an art and a
            science. Nursing education should help students develop knowledge, practical skills, ethical values and
            professional attitudes necessary to provide quality healthcare.</li>
        <li>The institution believes in holistic development of students through academic learning, clinical practice,
            community service and personal growth. We aim to prepare nurses who respect human dignity and are committed
            to improving the health of individuals, families and communities.</li>
    </ul>

</section>

